     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The verification tool should deal with import mapping to a different location.  In the current import-export tool, it is possible to export and re-import with a different path or port. The verifcation tool should be able to handle this. The relevant configuration options are 'resource', 'source', and 'map' (see below).",
