  "description": "<p>The verification tool should deal with import mapping to a different location.  In the current import-export tool, it is possible to export and re-import with a different path or port. The verifcation tool should be able to handle this. The relevant configuration options are 'resource', 'source', and 'map' (see below).<br/>\n```<br/>\n$ fcrepo-verify importexport.yml<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,556 INFO Loading configuration options from importexport.yml<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,556 INFO Loaded the following configuration options:<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; mode : import<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; predicates : <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains</a><br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; resource : <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a><br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; source : <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest</a><br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; map : <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest,http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest,http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a><br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; dir : /Users/lsitu/Documents/Fedora_Import_Export/data_1bbb_v48<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; binaries : True<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; inbound : False<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO --&gt; rdfLang : text/turtle<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,557 INFO Testing connection to <a href=\"http://localhost:8686\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686</a>...<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,575 INFO Connection successful.<br/>\n2017-05-26 16:42:52,575 INFO Starting verification...<br/>\n20